Please create a theme pack (zip) for the DeepSeek Harness Android console.
Spec: THEME-PACK-SPEC.md (or see console.schema.json + console.example.json)
Requirements: dark theme, low saturation, teal accent #2dd4bf; seaside night background (generate a 1080×2400 image named bg.jpg);
